(6842826, 1029257, 141319, '<td valign="top">great shot, love the way he looks straight at your camera. Since this was adv editing I would have probably got rid of these light coloured flecks - looks like something he was eating perhaps. I am also wondering if you could have cropped a bit of the dark body part off at the bottom. It seems to add little to nothing to the image IMO. OTOH I like the green at the top, it contrasts nicely with your subject.</td>', 'great shot, love the way he looks straight at your camera. Since this was adv editing I would have probably got rid of these light coloured flecks - looks like something he was eating perhaps. I am also wondering if you could have cropped a bit of the dark body part off at the bottom. It seems to add little to nothing to the image IMO. OTOH I like the green at the top, it contrasts nicely with your subject.', '2012-08-16 15:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
