(6843349, 1029130, 113591, '<td valign="top">Delicate, soulful and full of character. Will you please take my portrait as well? Thanks for the kind words on mine. I have 300 more I can show you Hehe. Seriously, if you ever get an opportunity to come to Africa, Hwange in Zimbabwe is the best for elephants. The light is fantastic, and one may still manoeuvre around a dam to have the sun at your back.</td>', 'Delicate, soulful and full of character. Will you please take my portrait as well? Thanks for the kind words on mine. I have 300 more I can show you Hehe. Seriously, if you ever get an opportunity to come to Africa, Hwange in Zimbabwe is the best for elephants. The light is fantastic, and one may still manoeuvre around a dam to have the sun at your back.', '2012-08-17 02:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
