(6843379, 1029016, 101668, '<td valign="top">Hwange selfs beter as Chobe! Baie geluk. Dit is waarvoor jy ''n kamera het. Moenie ophou nie. So jammer ek het nie gestem die afgelope weke nie, deadlines wag egter vir niemand nie. Baie geluk, dis ''n wonderlike foto en welverdiende lintjie.</td>', 'Hwange selfs beter as Chobe! Baie geluk. Dit is waarvoor jy ''n kamera het. Moenie ophou nie. So jammer ek het nie gestem die afgelope weke nie, deadlines wag egter vir niemand nie. Baie geluk, dis ''n wonderlike foto en welverdiende lintjie.', '2012-08-17 03:36:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6843394, 1029239, 137576, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and yes my first postumus blue :) wicked been after that for a year or more now :) <br/> <br/>Yep was at 7+ early on but guess ppl wanted fluffy nice images, <br/> <br/>Taken April 2 this year crazy snow storm in the peaks over a metre of drifting snow. <br/> <br/>I spent an hour rescuing 25 sheep and lambs, some where completely burried and probably resented me digging them out as it was blowing 50-60 mph winds. Pleased I had my thermal boiler suit with me, shot on my old 20d and efs that I keep in my truck<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments and yes my first postumus blue :) wicked been after that for a year or more now :)  Yep was at 7+ early on but guess ppl wanted fluffy nice images,  Taken April 2 this year crazy snow storm in the peaks over a metre of drifting snow.  I spent an hour rescuing 25 sheep and lambs, some where completely burried and probably resented me digging them out as it was blowing 50-60 mph winds. Pleased I had my thermal boiler suit with me, shot on my old 20d and efs that I keep in my truck ', '2012-08-17 03:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6843409, 1029016, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nou toe!!! Check net hier... BAIE geluk met die wen foto en ook die lint daarby. Jy weet nie hoe bly ek is vir jou nie en ek dink ek het laas jou naam gesien as een van die fotograwe wat op lys is as een van die beste fotograwe maar nog nie ''n lint nie..jammer...jy is nou af vanaf die lys :) Tyd om aan te beweeg en op te beweeg in die ranks...lol<br/>Groete</td>', 'Nou toe!!! Check net hier... BAIE geluk met die wen foto en ook die lint daarby. Jy weet nie hoe bly ek is vir jou nie en ek dink ek het laas jou naam gesien as een van die fotograwe wat op lys is as een van die beste fotograwe maar nog nie ''n lint nie..jammer...jy is nou af vanaf die lys :) Tyd om aan te beweeg en op te beweeg in die ranks...lolGroete', '2012-08-17 04:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6843412, 1029016, 108580, '<td valign="top">WD on the ribbon Herman! Just awesome Africa. Hwange of all places! You''re right about African light. All that red soil dust in the air gives those stunning golds and yellows. It is different here.</td>', 'WD on the ribbon Herman! Just awesome Africa. Hwange of all places! You''re right about African light. All that red soil dust in the air gives those stunning golds and yellows. It is different here.', '2012-08-17 04:32:20.000000', NULL, 0),
