(7090170, 1028790, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cory, wonderful photo and worthy of the high score for sure.  Now, I''ll nitpik a bit, based on conversation from this thread: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1217062" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bordering on Ridiculous</a> <br/> <br/>I like letterbox "borders" and this one works well - except I don''t care for the bleeding into the photo in the lower left.  Perhaps a 1 pixel wide dark grey border line just preceding the black would have offset it some?  :-)</td>', 'Cory, wonderful photo and worthy of the high score for sure.  Now, I''ll nitpik a bit, based on conversation from this thread: Bordering on Ridiculous  I like letterbox "borders" and this one works well - except I don''t care for the bleeding into the photo in the lower left.  Perhaps a 1 pixel wide dark grey border line just preceding the black would have offset it some?  :-)', '2013-08-20 13:01:13.000000', NULL, 0),
